                                "target_word": "inner circle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "199f313c-a8f0-32ae-a86c-490fefc0a46e",
                                        "entry_id": "a98f6340-1b4d-3a60-912a-759f12c068b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The group comprising one's closest friends or associates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20150960-c802-3a61-a72b-14b4208f206c",
                                        "entry_id": "a98f6340-1b4d-3a60-912a-759f12c068b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small, exclusive group of people close to the center of power who control a movement, organization, political party, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a435d6f5-143e-4bec-936a-b7119dddbb9e",
                                                "sense_id": "20150960-c802-3a61-a72b-14b4208f206c",
                                                "text": "It was upon his return to London that Bok learned, through the confidence of a member of the British “inner circle,” the amazing news that the war was practically over: that Bulgaria had capitulated and was suing for peace; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80dd4767-1189-435d-8f2d-91a4bf6699fc",
                                                "sense_id": "20150960-c802-3a61-a72b-14b4208f206c",
                                                "text": "Sassoon used the close relationship of Yedidia and Bankman-Fried to explore the FTX inner circle’s luxe lifestyle and allege how it hid a house of cards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f3df66e-2e76-45d6-8311-bc7d1d713c64",
                                                "sense_id": "20150960-c802-3a61-a72b-14b4208f206c",
                                                "text": "The idea of an alleged Epstein \"list\" was turbocharged by Trump's own inner circle, most notably by Bondi herself. In a February interview with Fox News, she claimed, \"The list of Jeffrey Epstein's clients is sitting on my desk.\" Her remark, quickly amplified by right-wing influencers, fueled weeks of speculation online and in MAGA circles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50b5642b-1eb5-3318-ba78-73f84e80984c",
                                        "entry_id": "a98f6340-1b4d-3a60-912a-759f12c068b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see inner, circle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
